sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Tom (handler)
    participant A as Ada (MemAgent)
    participant S as Skill store
    participant L as Chat model
    participant T as Beacon, Ringfence, Tally
    participant W as Workflow memory
    participant B as Background model

    P->>A: "CW-431803 is agreed. Pay it."
    A->>S: is there an active skill for this request?
    S-->>A: SKILL.md (or nothing)
    A->>L: instruction + skill + request + tool schemas
    loop until the model stops calling tools
        L-->>A: call this tool
        A->>T: run it
        T-->>A: result
    end
    A-->>P: reply
    A->>W: store the run: steps, results, outcome graded by your evaluator
    Note over W,B: Later, off the user's turn
    W->>B: the runs of one trajectory class that cleared the gates
    B-->>S: a SKILL.md, checked by code, stored in shadow
    Note over S: A person activates it. Only then does step 3 return it.
